OL,3,GNEWSAArsonist jailed for police station
OL,4,Apetrol bombing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who threw homemade petrol bombs
OL,7,Finto the grounds of a Kent police
OL,8,Fstation has been jailed for five years.
OL,10,FStacey Pearson, 41, from Ashford, threw
OL,11,Fthree petrol bombs over the rear wall
OL,12,Fof Ashford Police Station, setting fire
OL,13,Fto two marked police vehicles and an
OL,14,Felectric van, at about 02:50 GMT on 13
OL,15,FFebruary, the force said.
OL,17,FHe was found guilty of one count of
OL,18,Fassaulting an emergency worker and one
OL,19,Fcount of reckless arson at Canterbury
OL,20,FCrown Court before being sentenced on
OL,21,FFriday.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
