OL,3,GNEWSAArsonist jailed for police station
OL,4,Apetrol bombing
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile the flames were put out and no
OL,7,Finjuries were reported, PC Andrew
OL,8,FHuckstepp from Kent Police said
OL,9,FPearson's actions "could easily have
OL,10,Fhad devastating consequences for
OL,11,Fofficers and staff alike".
